Lets an index-only adoption through at a path a released commit holds
again, as before "Hold an index-only adoption at a path a released commit
holds": WantList::dispatch adopts an index-only want before it checks the
hold, reasoning that an adoption touches nothing on disk, so the path's
record moves on while the released commit may still land its own version
there (DESIGN.md §7.5). The simulator's check for commits in flight fails
the run.

test: delocal-sim regressions::a_released_commit_bars_an_adoption_at_its_path
